  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The strangest thing about that Friday was how ordinary the rest of it stayed.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.84
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Draw a circle five miles wide round the pit, and inside it people dug their gardens.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 6.792,
      "seconds": 6.66
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Children went up to bed. Students sat over their books.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 14.792,
      "seconds": 4.42
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "At the junction the trains came in and went out as they always had.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 23.25,
      "seconds": 4.11
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_newspaper_boy",
      "text": "Evening paper! Read all about it!",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 29.083,
      "seconds": 2.39
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Nothing in it said a word about any of this.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 33.208,
      "seconds": 3.56
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Men came in off the late train with it, talking over each other.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 40.792,
      "seconds": 4.61
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_shopman",
      "text": "I saw it myself. The thing has opened and there are men inside it.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 48.208,
      "seconds": 4.81
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "They made about as much stir as two drunks, and the trucks drowned them out.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 55.458,
      "seconds": 4.84
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Londonwards, four to a compartment, the carriages rocked on.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 62.333,
      "seconds": 4.42
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Two of them put their faces to the glass and looked out at the dark.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 70.792,
      "seconds": 4.34
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A spark going up, a red glow, smoke across the stars: a heath fire.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 77.167,
      "seconds": 5.76
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "On the bridges the crowd stayed, though the people in it kept changing.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 85.333,
      "seconds": 4.78
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "One or two went out into the dark to look closer, and stayed out there.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 92.917,
      "seconds": 4.39
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A beam went over the heather like a searchlight, hunting for something to burn.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 99.333,
      "seconds": 4.48
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The common itself lay quiet all night, and the dead lay on it.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 106.25,
      "seconds": 4.46
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Whatever the ray had touched was lying where it fell.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 113.542,
      "seconds": 3.59
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Somewhere under the sand a hammering went on, and went on.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 119.667,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_newspaper_boy",
      "text": "Men from Mars! Read it here, men from Mars!",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 127.458,
      "seconds": 3.67
    }
  ],
  "plan": "6d8325e67b5e913a"
}